      "title": "Luz Helena Gesha - DARK ROAST",
      "handle": "luz-helena-gesha-dark-roast",
      "body_html": "<p>The bougie dark roast special!</p>\n<p><strong>Tasting notes:</strong>\u00a0 Toffee Chews , Dark Chocolate , Creme Caramel</p>\n<p><strong>Funk Rating:</strong> 0/5</p>\n<p><strong>Varietals:</strong> Gesha</p>\n<p><strong>Altitude:</strong> 1500 masl</p>\n<p><strong>Region:</strong> Quindio , Colombia</p>\n<p><strong>Processing:</strong> Washed - harvested following strict ripeness criteria, floated and hand-sorted to remove defects. Cherries underwent 30 hours of underwater fermentation before being pulped, washed, and dried in controlled conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Importer:</strong> Cofinet<br><br><strong>Price We Paid: </strong>$20/lb<br><br><strong>Weight: </strong>115gm</p>",
