      "title": "Mystery Coffee League",
      "handle": "mystery-coffee-league-1",
      "body_html": "<p>Our second time participating in the Mystery Coffee League - and you're going to love this coffee. We can't give out any information on it, but it's a banger and absolutely worth picking up. If you're new to MCL, check out the US site here: https://us.mystery.coffee/ and consider participating for the month of April!<br><br></p>\n<p><span>Funk: wouldn't you like to know</span></p>\n<p>Our cost: can't say...</p>\n<p>Sourced from \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0<br><br>Sold in 115g bags roasted every Sunday</p>",
