      "id": 10397063151930,
      "title": "Lil Bit Of Everything Subscription x1 (20gx4)",
      "handle": "some-of-everything-subscription-20g",
      "body_html": "<p>One of each of our unique monthly subscription coffees, including our favorite print. Clean coffees will be rated .5/5 or less on the funk scale, and funky coffees will be at least a 1.5/5.\u00a0<br></p>\n<p>Each order after the first of the Some of Everything subscription will be discounted by $8 and will include a unique print (up to three prints maximum). E.g. ordering 3 Some of Everything subs will cost $44 ($20 + $12 + $12) and get you three tubes of each coffee, ~60g of each coffee.\u00a0</p>\n<p>Purchasing any CETO subscription will entitle you to a $5 off discount code on any addon orders (stacks with other promotions). Shipping for addon coffees will be bundled with the subscription fulfillment.<br><br>Shipping is free within the US.\u00a0</p>",
